From: LLVM XttSFPU Backend <llvm-tt-sfpu@local>
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] RISCV: Add SFPU instruction encoding formats and definitions

Add 8 encoding format classes and 43 instruction definitions for the
Tenstorrent SFPU vector unit (opcodes 0x70-0x95 + BH extensions).
Includes both BH and WH load/store encoding variants.

All encodings validated against sfpu-ops-bh.h and sfpu-ops-wh.h
(216 encoding tests pass).

---
 llvm/lib/Target/RISCV/RISCVInstrInfo.td |  3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

--- a/llvm/lib/Target/RISCV/RISCVInstrInfo.td
+++ b/llvm/lib/Target/RISCV/RISCVInstrInfo.td
@@ -end of vendor extension includes
+// Tenstorrent SFPU instructions
+include "RISCVInstrInfoXttSFPU.td"
+include "RISCVXttSFPUISelPatterns.td"
